OL,3,GNEWSABook swaps turn seafront into
OL,4,Aopen-air library
OL,5,
OL,6,FBook lovers are being invited to
OL,7,Fcombine a good read with a sea view
OL,8,Fafter four Little Libraries sprang up
OL,9,Falong the coast.
OL,11,FThe book cases have been installed on
OL,12,FSunderland seafront where holidaymakers
OL,13,Fand local people can borrow, exchange
OL,14,For replace a book.
OL,16,FThe aim is to get visitors to enjoy
OL,17,Freading by the sea by choosing one of
OL,18,Fthe libraries' offerings, while at the
OL,19,Fsame time giving a new home to books
OL,20,Fwhich might otherwise be gathering dust
OL,21,Fat home.
