OL,3,GNEWSABook swaps turn seafront into
OL,4,Aopen-air library
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Little Libraries have been set up
OL,7,Fat The Seaburn Inn, The Tram Shelter,
OL,8,FAdventure Sunderland and the Marina by
OL,9,Fthe city's Seafront Volunteer Group and
OL,10,FSunderland Seafront BID.
